  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">National Crime Agency Deployments to Africa 19/20</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity National Crime Agency Deployments to Africa 19/20 is a component of Strengthening Transnational Responses to Countering Illicit Financial Flows, Corruption and Organised Crime in Africa (CIFFS)  reported by FCDO with a funding type of 104 - Procurement of Services and a budget of &#xa3;2,330,525. This project benefits Africa, regional. It works in the following sector(s): Public sector policy and administrative management, Decentralisation and support to subnational government.</narrative>
  </description>
